<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 8.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 8.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for Thursday, May 8:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,496.80 (1,497.00)	CHF  1,027.30 (1,017.30)</p>
<p>    DEM    871.25 (865.42)	  GBP  2,451.30 (2,449.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    123.80 (122.93)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Wednesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $14.13 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$12.35 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $26.48 million ($44.48 million) -- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
